---
import { repo } from '../hubs.mjs';
---
<section id="next" class="rounded-[1.25rem] bg-[#e6eefc] p-6 sm:p-8" aria-labelledby="next-title">
  <p class="mb-3 inline-block rounded-full bg-night px-3 py-1 text-sm font-bold text-solar">Open proposal, reviewers wanted</p>
  <h2 id="next-title">Next idea: a microscope collection plate</h2>
  <p class="mt-3 mb-5 max-w-2xl text-muted">Point a small microscope camera at an exposed plate and send each image to the ground. Schools with receive stations compare passes and log what changed. The loop works on a bench, on a balloon and, after review, in orbit. The same skills carry over to future lunar projects.</p>
  <a class="font-semibold underline underline-offset-4" href={repo + '/blob/main/docs/micro-collection-plate.md'}>Read and review the proposal</a>
</section>
